sequenceDiagram
    actor R as Agent RH
    participant NG as Angular
    participant CC as ConventionController
    participant CS as ConventionService
    participant PDF as ConventionPdfService
    participant NS as NotificationService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    R->>NG: genere la convocation d'un stage
    NG->>CC: POST /api/conventions/generer/{stageId}
    CC->>CS: generer(stageId)
    CS->>DB: cree convention (n0, dates)
    CS->>NS: notifie le stagiaire (convocation prete)
    CS-->>NG: 200 ConventionResponse

    R->>NG: affecte l'entite d'accueil
    NG->>CC: PATCH /api/conventions/{id}/entite-accueil
    CC->>CS: affecterEntiteAccueil(id, entite)
    CS->>DB: maj entite_accueil

    R->>NG: telecharge le PDF
    NG->>CC: GET /api/conventions/{id}/pdf
    CC->>PDF: genererPdf(convention)
    Note over PDF: iText 7 — logo, badge,<br/>tableau, QR code (1 page)
    PDF-->>CC: document PDF
    CC-->>NG: application/pdf
